# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Deliberately no SPA fallback ("/* /index.html 200").
#
# Every route has its own prerendered file (dist/<route>/index.html, generated
# by scripts/generate-static-routes.mjs), so Cloudflare Pages serves it directly.
# Any other path gets a real 404 status with dist/404.html instead of a 200 with
# the SPA shell, so scanners and search engines see that it does not exist.
